@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### Search with location

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola&latitude=41.998100&longitude=21.425400


### Nearest Coca-Cola

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola&latitude=41.998100&longitude=21.425400&sort=distanceAsc


### Within 1 km

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola&latitude=41.998100&longitude=21.425400&radiusKm=1&sort=distanceAsc


### Within 3 km

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola&latitude=41.998100&longitude=21.425400&radiusKm=3&sort=distanceAsc


### Within 5 km

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?latitude=41.998100&longitude=21.425400&radiusKm=5&sort=distanceAsc


### In stock + nearest

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?q=Coca-Cola&status=IN_STOCK&latitude=41.998100&longitude=21.425400&sort=distanceAsc


### Missing longitude - expected 400

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?latitude=41.998100


### Invalid latitude - expected 400

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?latitude=120&longitude=21.425400


### Invalid longitude - expected 400

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?latitude=41.998100&longitude=200


### Radius without coordinates - expected 400

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?radiusKm=5


### Distance sort without location - expected 400

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/search?sort=distanceAsc